Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a> 0–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Malmö FF\">Malmö</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(9 augusti 1997)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a> 3–5 <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_SK_FK\" title=\"Västerås SK FK\">Västerås</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(1 juni 1997)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;05546.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>5&#160;546<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_1996\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 1996\">1996</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_1998\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 1998\">1998</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"float:right;clear:right;width:374px;padding:4px;border:1px solid silver;margin:4px;background-color:white\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid silver;padding:0px;width:370px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fil:Sweden_location_map,_40south.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Sweden_location_map%2C_40south.svg/500px-Sweden_location_map%2C_40south.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"370\" height=\"428\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Sweden_location_map%2C_40south.svg/