e\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-0.5em; left:-2.5em; width:6em;text-align:center;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96rebro_SK_Fotboll\" title=\"Örebro SK Fotboll\">Örebro</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:39.5%; left:61%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">Norrköping</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:54.2%; left:26.8%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:6em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Elfsborg\" title=\"IF Elfsborg\">Elfsborg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:83.5%; left:24.4%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helsingborgs_IF\" title=\"Helsingborgs IF\">Helsingborg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:72.5%; left:26.1%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:95%; left:29.2%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trelleborgs_FF\" title=\"Trelleborgs FF\">Trelleborg</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:45.9%; left:16.3%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ljungskile_SK\" title=\"Ljungskile SK\">Ljungskile</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Placering av deltagande lag, allsvenskan 1997.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Fotbollsallsvenskan 1997</b> spelades 6 april–26 oktober 1997 och vanns av <a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstads BK</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Upplägg\"><span id=\"Uppl.C3.A4gg\"></span>Upplägg</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Upplägg\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Upplägg\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Serien bestod av 26 omgångar. Lag 11 och 12 fick spela nedflyttningskval medan Lag 13 och 14 flyttades ner. En seger gav 3 poäng, ett oavgjort resultat gav 1 poäng och en förlust gav 0 poäng.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Förlopp\"><span id=\"F.C3.B6rlopp\"></span>Förlopp</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Förlopp\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Förlopp\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>Den 10 april 1997 skickades ett hotbrev, med avsändaren \"AIK Terror\", ut till Sveriges elitdomare, med hot om att skada domarnas familjer om de inte dömde till <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK:s</a> fördel.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Matchen <a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstads BK</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll\" title=\"AIK Fotboll\">AIK</a> den 1 september 1997 var den frösta matchen som sändes i <a href=\"/wiki/C_More_Entertainment\" title=\"C More Entertainment\">Canal +</a>. Målet gjordes av <a href=\"/wiki/Fredrik_Ljungberg\" title=\"Fredrik Ljungberg\">Fredrik Ljungberg</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable infobox\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#ffec8b;\">&#8195;\n</td>\n<td>Svenska mästare\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Champions_League_1998/1999\" title=\"Uefa Champions League 1998/1999\">Champions League 1998/1999</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d7e6f5\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefacupen_1998/1999\" title=\"Uefacupen 1998/1999\">Uefacupen 1998/1999</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#ecf5f3\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Europeiska_cupvinnarcupen_i_fotboll_1998/1999\" title=\"Europeiska cupvinnarcupen i fotboll 1998/1999\">Cupvinnarcupen 1998/1999</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#e2ecea\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Intertotocupen_1998\" title=\"Intertotocupen 1998\">Intertotocupen 1998</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#f4dcdc\">&#8195;</td>\n<td><a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Kval_till_Allsvenskan_1998\">Kvalspel om Allsvenskan 1998</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#f0c4c4\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Nedflyttad till <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_1998\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll 1998\">Division 1 1998</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Fotbollsallsvenskan 1997\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_1997&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; bo